      "sample_posts": [
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "TrendForce: NVIDIA, AMD, and other foreign suppliers are expected to see their combined shipment share in China shrink to roughly 10% in 2026.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2086666728210301252",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T12:11:31.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 237
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "FT Exclusive: A consortium of groups including Apollo Global, Blackstone, BlackRock’s Global Infrastructure Partners unit, Brookfield Asset Management, Goldman Sachs and KKR is entering a partnership with Nvidia to invest in the AI build-out.  https:// ft.trib.al/GIv2o1R",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2086852994981560775",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:31:40.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 192
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Wall Street giants partner with Nvidia on $500bn AI financing deal",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2086854731020767394",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:38:34.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 64
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Ultra-High Interactivity on NVIDIA GPUs? TileRT InferenceX Can TileRT software on NVIDIA GPU compete with Cerebras, Groq LPU, SambaNova? Batch Size 1, Disaggregated engine, High throughput prefill engine, High interactivity decode engine",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086697535549440370",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:13:56.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 43
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Right on cue, this reports each Rubin rack uses 4500 premium smartphone worth of LPDDR chips. So, if Nvidia sells 7.2m Rubin chips or 100k racks, that would be equivalent to 450m premium smartphones of Chips. Global premium phone mkt is < 450m.",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2086687026162880538",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T13:32:10.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 31
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "GPUs and the custom ASICs cloud vendors design both need 2.5D packaging to sit with HBM. TSMC  $TSM  holds most of that capacity under the CoWoS name, and NVIDIA  $NVDA  has also qualified Amkor  $AMKR  and ASE  $ASX .  Morgan Stanley works back from 2027 CoWoS capacity and gets roughly",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086815077852967328",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T22:01:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 9,
      "label": "dram / hbm / nand / cxmt",
      "own_count": 1,
      "competitor_count": 4,
      "competitor_engagement": 170,
      "competitors_covering": [
        "QQ_Timmy",
        "tphuang",
