      ],
      "sample_posts": [
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "My first article is on the emerging DRAM crisis for China. Memory chips are needed everywhere. While Apple may be suffering a little bit, the lower priced Chinese OEMs will be bearing the brunt of demand destruction unless CXMT & YMTC dramatically raise production.",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2086635868899659862",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:08:53.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 110
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "UBS 美光 (  $MU  ) 報告  •  NAND 有些噪音（近期待估略下修），但 DRAM（尤其 HBM）比先前預期更緊俏。 •  維持 買進評等，目標價 1,625 美元 不變。  HBM / DRAM  •  HBM 供需實際更緊，HBM4 與 HBM4E 定價強於預期。 •  2027 年產業混合 HBM ASP 上修至 年增約 79%（先前 +61%），HBM4E 可能突破",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2086788330738577480",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T20:14:43.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 46
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Our read on FMS 2026, the Future of Memory and Storage show.  FMS 2024 was about AI training, 2025 about inference, and 2026 about agents. Scaling inference and agents runs into a shortage of HBM and local DRAM, and that shortage is now the bottleneck. Getting around it was a",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086673702855557550",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T12:39:13.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 14
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "UBS: Memory  Rapid Growth in Shipments: Global HBM bit shipments (measured in millions of Gb) show a steady, exponential upward trajectory from 2023 through the projected year 2027.  Share of DRAM Shipments: HBM as a percentage of total DRAM shipments is expanding significantly,",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086820079346520084",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T22:20:52.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 0
        }
      ]
    }
